WEBVTT

00:04:24.218 --> 00:04:30.182
We should make and give academic credit
for life experiences.

00:04:31.392 --> 00:04:35.521
Why sit through an entire
business management course

00:04:35.521 --> 00:04:37.273
for a semester,

00:04:37.315 --> 00:04:40.735
when you can have
a university evaluator assess you

00:04:40.776 --> 00:04:42.445
based on your experience?

00:04:43.404 --> 00:04:45.197
So this is what this would look like.

00:04:45.197 --> 00:04:47.283
Let's take a student, Brandice.

00:04:47.742 --> 00:04:50.870
Brandice is an automotive technician
at a car service center.

00:04:51.912 --> 00:04:55.499
Now let’s take three
of the certifications that she received

00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.336
and is required for her to do her work:

00:04:58.377 --> 00:05:00.421
electrical systems;